ut other Pokémon from its pond.",[24]="Loving to battle, this Pokémon pinches all Pokémon that enter its territory with its pincers and throws them out.",[25]="Crawdaunt has an extremely violent nature that compels it to challenge other living things to battle. Other life-forms refuse to live in ponds inhabited by this Pokémon, making them desolate places.",[26]="Crawdaunt molts (sheds) its shell regularly. Immediately after molting, its shell is soft and tender. Until the shell hardens, this Pokémon hides in its streambed burrow to avoid attack from its foes.",[29]="Its temperament is rough and it loves to fight, but as soon as its pincers break off, it turns cowardly. It stays timid until they grow back.",[30]="Its pincers often fall off. Unlike with Crabrawler or Clauncher, the meat in its claws is utterly nasty and stinking.",[33]="A rough customer that wildly flails its giant claws. It is said to be extremely hard to raise.",[34]="A brutish Pokémon that loves to battle. It will crash itself into any foe that approaches its nest."},es={[23]="Este malandrín usa sus pinzas para atosigar y expulsar a los otros Pokémon que viven en su estanque.",[24]="De naturaleza violenta. Si un Pokémon se aventura en su territorio, lo agarra con sus tenazas y lo arroja por los aires.",[25]="Crawdaunt es de una naturaleza extremadamente violenta que le lleva a desafiar a otros seres vivos. Hay formas de vida que se niegan a vivir en los estanques donde habitan estos Pokémon, y los dejan medio vacíos.",[26]="Crawdaunt muda el caparazón regularmente y, en cuanto lo hace, se le queda la piel tersa y suave. Mientras el nuevo caparazón se endurece, permanece escondido en su madriguera para que no le ataquen.",[29]="Su carácter agresivo le incita a pelear siempre que puede, pero si se le rompe una pinza se amedrenta y acobarda hasta que se le regenera.",[30]="Pierde las pinzas fácilmente. Al contrario que las de Crabrawler o Clauncher, su carne apesta a lodo y tiene un sabor desagradable.",[33]="Esta violenta criatura agita de forma salvaje las gigantes pinzas que tiene. Dicen que es muy difícil criarlo.",[34]="Le encanta pelear, debido a su naturaleza. Si alguien se acerca a su madriguera, le propinará una paliza sin ningún tipo de miramiento."},pt="Um Pokémon bruto que adora lutar. Investe contra qualquer inimigo que se aproxime do seu ninho."},evo={{s=341},{s=342,from=341,c={{t="level-up",lv=30}}}},moves={[5]={1,145,1,106,1,11,1,43,7,106,10,11,13,43,20,61,23,182,26,282,34,269,39,152,44,14,52,12},[6]={1,145,1,106,1,11,1,43,7,106,10,11,13,43,20,61,23,182,26,282,34,269,39,152,44,14,52,12},[7]={1,145,1,106,1,11,1,43,7,106,10,11,13,43,19,61,22,182,25,282,33,269,38,152,43,14,51,242,56,12},[8]={1,145,1,106,1,11,1,43,7,106,10,11,13,43,20,61,23,182,26,282,30,129,34,269,39,400,44,152,52,14,57,242,65,12},[9]={1,145,1,106,1,11,1,43,7,106,10,11,13,43,20,61,23,182,26,282,30,129,34,269,39,400,44,152,52,14,57,242,65,12},[10]={1,145,1,106,1,11,1,43,7,106,10,11,13,43,20,61,23,182,26,282,30,129,34,269,39,400,44,152,52,14,57,242,65,12},[11]={1,145,1,106,1,11,1,43,7,106,10,11,13,43,20,61,23,182,26,282,30,129,34,269,39,400,44,152,52,14,57,242,65,12},[12]={1,145,1,106,1,11,1,43,7,106,10,11,13,43,20,61,23,182,26,282,34,269,39,152,44,14,52,12},[13]={1,145,1,106,1,11,1,43,7,106,10,11,13,43,20,61,23,182,26,282,34,269,39,152,44,14,52,12},[14]={1,145,1,106,1,11,1,43,7,106,10,11,13,43,20,61,23,182,26,282,30,129,34,269,39,400,44,152,52,14,57,242,65,12},[15]={1,12,1,145,1,106,1,11,1,43,7,106,10,11,13,43,20,61,23,182,26,282,30,129,34,269,39,400,44,152,52,14,57,242,65,12},[16]={1,145,1,106,1,11,1,43,5,106,7,11,10,43,14,61,17,182,20,458,23,282,26,400,30,129,32,534,36,269,40,14,43,242,48,152,54,12},[17]={0,129,1,129,1,145,1,106,1,11,1,43,5,106,7,11,10,43,14,61,17,182,20,458,23,282,26,400,32,534,36,269,40,14,43,242,48,152,54,12},[18]={0,129,1,129,1,145,1,106,1,11,1,43,5,106,7,11,10,43,14,61,17,182,20,458,23,282,26,400,32,534,36,269,40,14,43,242,48,152,54,12},[20]={0,129,1,129,1,55